# `.env` is committed on purpose (public Mapbox token). `.env.local` stays out
# so anyone can override it with their own token without touching the repo.
.env.local

# Scratch folder for full-size source art and font downloads. What the app
# actually serves is committed under `public/assets`, already sized for the web.
# Anchored to the root: unanchored, a case-insensitive checkout reads it as
# `assets/` too and silently drops everything the app serves.
/Assets/
